          When ordering the $7 Meal Deal, ask the cashier: <em>"Can I upgrade my sundae to a Mini Blizzard?"</em> At over 90% of participating stores, they will swap it for just $1.00 to $1.50 extra, turning a regular sundae into an Oreo or Reese's Blizzard worth $3.49–$4.29.
