        <h3 style="font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:700;color:#0B1E38;margin:0 0 8px;">Layered Mix-In Request for Blizzards</h3>
        <p style="font-size:0.9rem;color:#475569;line-height:1.6;margin:0;">
          Nothing is worse than finishing the top third of a Blizzard only to find plain vanilla soft serve at the bottom. Politely ask the crew member to <em>"layer the mix-ins halfway down"</em> or blend slightly less so candy chunks maintain distinct crunch from top to bottom.
        </p>
      </div>

